{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F103615702315256_1070387752301257+-+It%E2%80%99s+been+25+years+since+the+horrific+terror+attacks+changed+our+world.+Back+then+I+was+working+in+Washington%2C+D.C.+and+on+that+morning+was+part+of+a+national+tribal+leaders+summit+in+downtown+D.C.+when+the+attacks+happened.+There+was+such+a+suffocating+sense+of+dread+as+hundreds+of+us+gathered+around+the+Hyatt+hotel%E2%80%99s+coffee+shop+TV+to+watch+what+was+happening+live+in+NY+and+DC.+But+then%2C+even+through+the+panic+there+was+also+a+growing+sense+of+calmness+and+determination+to+make+sure+we+all+would+be+OK.+I+remember+that+night+feeling+so+amazed+at+how+%EF%BF%BCeveryone+joined+together+in+spirit+that+day%3A+there+was+unity%2C+pride%2C+love+and+compassion.+Our+nation%E2%80%99s+resolve+was+put+to+the+test%2C+and+we+passed+the+test+with+flying+colors.+That+is+the+America+I+love+and+still+love."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F103615702315256_1071465848860114+-+What+a+beautiful+celebration+of+Recovery%2C+Perseverance%2C+Achievement%2C+and+Hope.I+was+honored+to+attend+the+most+recent+graduation+ceremony+for+participants+in+the+King+County+Drug+Court+graduation.+What+I+witnessed+was+more+than+a+ceremony.+It+was+an+entire+community+coming+together+to+rescue+and+rebuild+lives.+Judges%2C+court+staff%2C+health+care+professionals%2C+law+enforcement%2C+families%2C+and+peers+all+working+together+to+create+new+beginnings+and+new+leases+on+life.+As+one+mother+tearfully+told+her+son%2C+%E2%80%9Cyou%E2%80%99ve+been+blessed+with+a+crown+of+beauty+instead+of+ashes.%E2%80%9DI+also+attended+part+of+the+Seattle+Police+Department%E2%80%99s+%E2%80%9CBefore+the+Badge%E2%80%9D+Program+and+saw+how+new+recruits+were+introduced+to+the+Drug+Court+program.+They+met+with+the+Drug+Court+Judge+and+professional+staff%2C+including+peers+who+themselves+are+graduates+and+in+recovery%2C+to+learn+about+the+policies%2C+best+practices%2C+and+behavioral+science+that+make+the+program+so+effective.+As+a+police+veteran+explained+to+the+recruits%2C+it%E2%80%99s+one+of+the+few+areas+where+police+officers+get+to+see+how+their+work+is+changing+lives.+I+am+so+grateful+to+see+how+the+Drug+Court+and+BTB+programs+are+both+working+to+save+and+rebuild+lives."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F103615702315256_1073297185343647+-+John+Lewis+said+it+best%3A+%22the+vote+is+the+most+powerful+nonviolent+change+agent+you+have+in+a+democratic+society.%22+%F0%9F%93%AC+Today%2C+the+U.S.+Supreme+Court+blocked+Trump%27s+horrible+plan+to+restrict+our+right+to+vote+by+mail+in+the+fall+elections.+Our+right+to+vote+must+remain+sacred."
},
