},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F103615702315256_1094126223260743+-+Thank+you+to+everyone+who+came+out+to+the+Candidates+Forum+to+%EF%BF%BClearn+about+the+candidates+for+the+WA+State+House+and+Senate+from+the+47th%2C+33rd%2C+and+5th+LDs%21We+discussed+energy%2C+policing%2C+homelessness%2C+addiction%2C+natural+disasters%2C+data+centers%2C+and+schools+over+the+course+of+two+hours.+And+we+did+it+in+cordial%2C+respectful%2C+and+even+friendly+way+-+proof+that+civility+in+politics+is+not+a+lost+art+or+virtue.Thank+you+the+Covington+Chamber+Of+Commerce+-+Covington%2C+WA+and+the+Kent+Chamber+of+Commerce+for+organizing+this+forum.+And+thank+you+to+the+many+sponsors+including+the+47th+District+Democrats.+And+thank+you+to+my+seatmates+Vote+Claudia+Kauffman+and+Elect+Debra+Entenman+for+your+courage+and+support%21+And+how+could+I+forget+to+praise+Carmen+Goers+and+Rod+Meyers+for+an+outstanding+job+of+moderating."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1090487570291275+-+I+want+to+talk+to+you+about+this+upcoming+election.+The+truth+is%2C+it%E2%80%99s+not+about+left+versus+right.+It%E2%80%99s+something+just+far+more+simple.+And+that+is%3A+right+versus+wrong.Is+it+right+that+the+Trump+Admin+is+cutting+millions+of+people%E2%80%99s+healthcare+through+the+Medicaid+cuts%3F+That+includes+thousands+of+people+right+here+in+this+district.And+is+it+right+that+the+Trump+Administration+is+still+trying+to+interfere+with+our+election%3FYou%E2%80%99d+agree+with+me+that+those+are+wrong%2C+and+I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+be+fighting+against+them.But+I+also+believe+that+it%E2%80%99s+really+important+to+fight+to+grow+our+economy%2C+to+support+the+brand+new+space+industry+that+is+being+built+out+right+here+in+this+district.And+I+think+it%E2%80%99s+also+important+to+protect+the+natural+beauty+of+our+world+for+our+children.Those+things+are+right.And+I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+be+fighting+for+those+things+too.So%2C+I%E2%80%99m+glad+that+you+care+about%2C+and+are+focused+on%2C+the+difference+between+right+and+wrong%2C+not+right+versus+left.And+your+support+and+your+vote+will+give+us+the+energy+to+keep+on+fighting+for+those+things+in+the+future+and+for+our+district.www.chris4wa.com"
},
